 evaluation:{title:['무엇을 맞히고, 무엇을 놓쳤을까?','What was detected, and what was missed?'],caption:['양성은 찾으려는 대상입니다. 정밀도는 TP/(TP+FP), 재현율은 TP/(TP+FN)입니다.','Positive means the target class. Precision = TP/(TP+FP); recall = TP/(TP+FN).'],kind:'matrix'},
